{"2330110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Yerba Buena", "steam_appid": 2330110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2f822c1a3ed8d13181cd458bdb0473e7.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1560 height=320 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal puzzle-platforming adventure as Barb, a young woman living as an NPC in an abandoned gameworld. Your beloved city of San Francisco is under threat from a sinister plot and it is up to you to save it with the help of a mysterious and powerful device: the Oscillator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/56ed18b35c1dcec54a665b11df9f7210.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1560 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a ground-breaking “Copy and Paste” mechanic and manipulate the gameworld by applying the movement and physical traits of objects onto others. Give a table the bounce of a trampoline, send entire buildings across city blocks or turn solid walls into thin air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/4eafe24b7a8bee4543c41f7f2fa7e5f5.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1560 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an original video game world set in 1970’s San Francisco and save your city from greed and destruction! Use your Oscillator to solve ingenious puzzles, track down a dangerous gang of bikers with superpowers, and discover the origins of the mysterious glitch that threatens San Francisco.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/4b06c13de9f85a19c5427b85e93a98ee.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1560 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Barb, a young woman struggling to find her way in 1970s San Francisco. Become the main character you were never meant to be with the help of your friends Russell, Wanda, Jorge, and some unlikely allies! </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2f822c1a3ed8d13181cd458bdb0473e7.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1560 height=320 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a surreal puzzle-platforming adventure as Barb, a young woman living as an NPC in an abandoned gameworld. Your beloved city of San Francisco is under threat from a sinister plot and it is up to you to save it with the help of a mysterious and powerful device: the Oscillator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/56ed18b35c1dcec54a665b11df9f7210.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1560 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/d2d9b4a0170204ab461cd6aa9dd4b7c3.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a ground-breaking “Copy and Paste” mechanic and manipulate the gameworld by applying the movement and physical traits of objects onto others. Give a table the bounce of a trampoline, send entire buildings across city blocks or turn solid walls into thin air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/4eafe24b7a8bee4543c41f7f2fa7e5f5.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1560 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/5ad38750a74c792bb10d8192176f3a68.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an original video game world set in 1970’s San Francisco and save your city from greed and destruction! Use your Oscillator to solve ingenious puzzles, track down a dangerous gang of bikers with superpowers, and discover the origins of the mysterious glitch that threatens San Francisco.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/4b06c13de9f85a19c5427b85e93a98ee.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1560 height=320 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.poster.avif?t=1784712333\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.webm?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/extras/2e5d82791eb9105c7c8e29cd4520f836.mp4?t=1784712333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Barb, a young woman struggling to find her way in 1970s San Francisco. Become the main character you were never meant to be with the help of your friends Russell, Wanda, Jorge, and some unlikely allies! </p>", "short_description": "Dive into a surreal 1970s gameworld and save San Francisco from a sinister threat. Play as Barb, and use the Oscillator to capture and reapply the physical traits of objects to solve mind-bending environmental platforming puzzles.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/f533108d4f7d6dd8d3ee9d4dac64d188a804ec33/header.jpg?t=1784712333", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/afea0e6c34f3cb5fda9888b7095f6701b2dab290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784712333", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330110/afea0e6c34f3cb5fda9888b7095f6701b2dab290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784712333", "website": "https://www.focus-entmt.com/games/yerba-buena", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 2600 / Intel Core i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 580 / Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required. 30 F